  "full_text": "Working Families Party\n\nMenu Close\n\nOur 2026 Candidates\n\nLatest News\n\nEvents\n\nWorking Families Guarantee\n\nOur 2026 Candidates\n\nLatest News\n\nEvents\n\nSign Up\n\nDonate\n\nAbout\n\nStates\n\nArizona\n\nCalifornia\n\nColorado\n\nConnecticut\n\nDelaware\n\nGeorgia\n\nMassachusetts\n\nMichigan\n\nNew Jersey\n\nNew Mexico\n\nNew York\n\nOhio\n\nOregon\n\nPennsylvania\n\nRhode Island\n\nTexas\n\nWashington\n\nWisconsin\n\nGet Active\n\nBecome a WFP member\n\nStore\n\nSign Up\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nJobs\n\nMedia Center\n\nPublic Filings\n\nMedia Inquiries\n\nContact\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nContribute\n\nMaking Our Nation\n\nWork for the Many,\n\nNot the Few.\n\nGet Active\n\nBecome a WFP Member\n\nMake your plan to vote\n\nJoin a Welcome Gathering\n\nVolunteer with WFP\n\nApply for our endorsement\n\nWe’re building a multiracial party of working people to transform our country.\n\nState by state and community by community, WFP is building a political home for all of us who see bigotry, bailouts, and business as usual in our political system and ask, “Is that the best we can do?”\n\nWho We Are Membership Our Candidates\n\nLatest\n\nThe Working Families Guarantee\n\nFirst Suffolk Update\n\nWorking Families Party Shocks Establishment In Some of the Country’s Toughest Swing Seats\n\nWisconsin Working Families Party Endorses Primary Candidates\n\nWFP Launches Effort To Recruit 1,000 Candidates Across The South\n\nNYWFP Opposes Open Primaries\n\nSouthern Made: Lead Where You Live\n\nNYWFP Statement On Trump’s Healthcare Cuts\n\nRhode Island Working Families Party Endorses Slate Fighting for Rent Stabilization, Accountable Schools, and an Affordable Providence\n\nColorado Working Families Party Celebrates Primary Victories\n\nView All News\n\nStay Up to Date:\n\nText ‘WFP’ to 30403\n\nContribute\n\nHelp us fight back and build build real, lasting power for working people across the country with a contribution today.\n\n$10 $27 $100 $250 Other Amount\n\nWorking Families Party\n\nOur 2026 Candidates\n\nLatest News\n\nEvents\n\nSign Up\n\nDonate\n\nAbout\n\nStates\n\nArizona\n\nCalifornia\n\nColorado\n\nConnecticut\n\nDelaware\n\nGeorgia\n\nMassachusetts\n\nMichigan\n\nNew Jersey\n\nNew Mexico\n\nNew York\n\nOhio\n\nOregon\n\nPennsylvania\n\nRhode Island\n\nTexas\n\nWashington\n\nWisconsin\n\nGet Active\n\nBecome a WFP member\n\nStore\n\nSign Up\n\nFacebook\n\nTwitter\n\nInstagram\n\nYouTube\n\nJobs\n\nMedia Center\n\nPublic Filings\n\nMedia Inquiries\n\nContact\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nContact By Mail\n\nWorking Families Party 77 Sands St. #6 Brooklyn, NY 11201\n\nMade with Middle Seat\n\nBy taking action on this page, I affirm my intent to join or continue as a member of the Working Families Party, and to receive periodic updates from WFP.\n\nPaid For By Working Families Party",
